Task Commands:&#xD;
Usage: exxerai task &lt;command&gt; [options]&#xD;
Commands:&#xD;
  list      List all tasks&#xD;
  create    Create a new task&#xD;
  assign    Assign a task to an agent&#xD;
  update    Update task agentStatus&#xD;
  delete    Delete a task&#xD;
  agentStatus    Show detailed task information&#xD;
  overdue   List overdue tasks&#xD;
Examples:&#xD;
  exxerai task list&#xD;
  exxerai task list --agentStatus pending&#xD;
  exxerai task create "Process Value" --type DataProcessing --priority High&#xD;
  exxerai task assign 12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012 87654321-4321-4321-4321-210987654321&#xD;
  exxerai task update 12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012 --agentStatus Completed&#xD;
